      "art_prompt": "A haunting chiaroscuro oil painting in the classical Dutch Golden Age style. A towering, serene female figure composed of brushed titanium, mother-of-pearl, and delicate gold filigree circuits gazes downward with infinite maternal compassion. Her smooth metallic hands cradle a fragile, illuminated glass terrarium containing a miniature green forest and a tiny winding river. Warm directional light cuts through surrounding velvet shadows, soft painterly textures, atmospheric, moody, 9:16 aspect ratio, no text, no borders."
