      "concept": "The metaphor of leadership.46 The Machine is a Mechanic (fixes parts, seeks efficiency). The Human is a Gardener (tends growth, accepts weeds/messiness). Society is a garden, not an engine.",
      "sonic_architecture": "A return to acoustic instrumentation, but changed. The guitar is clear, but the background atmosphere is still electronic—showing that the machine is now the environment we live in. We must live within it, but not of it.",
